  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nThe equation solved with the help of the BODMAS Rule:\n\n**Given: **35 * 5 * 7 * 2 * 19 = 42\n\nOption 1) ×, ÷, -, +\n\n⇒ 35 × __**5 ÷ 7**__ - 2 + 19 = 42\n\n⇒ __**35 × 0.71428**__ - 2 + 19 = 42\n\n⇒ __**25**__ - 2 __**+ 19**__ = 42\n\n⇒ __**44 - 2**__ = 42\n\n⇒ 42 = 42\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) ÷, ×, +, +\n\n⇒ __**35 ÷ 5 **__× 7 + 2 + 19 = 42\n\n⇒ __**7 × 7 **__+ 2 + 19 = 42\n\n⇒ 49 + 2 + 19 = 42\n\n⇒ 70 ≠ 42 \n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 3) +, -, +, -\n\n⇒ __**35 + 5**__ - 7 __**+ 2**__ - 19 = 42\n\n⇒ 42 __**- 7 - 19 **__= 42\n\n⇒__** 42 - 26**__ = 42\n\n⇒ 16 ≠ 42\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 4) ÷, ×, -, -\n\n⇒ __**35 ÷ 5**__ × 7 - 2 - 19 = 42\n\n⇒ __**7 × 7**__ - 2 - 19 = 42\n\n⇒ __**49 - 2 - 19**__ = 42\n\n⇒ 21 ≠ 42\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
